OL,6,G     Sea
OL,7,     FIn Marseille the cruisers take a
OL,8,     Fwalking tour, play Petanque, learn
OL,9,     Fhow to make delicious macarons,
OL,10,     Fand sample some ales at a local
OL,11,     Fbrewery.
OL,12,G1100 Holidaying with Jane McDonald
OL,13,     FJane and guests learn how to make
OL,14,     Fgood holidays great. This time
OL,15,     FJane's in Malta, Emmerdale's Chris
OL,16,     FBisson explores Belfast by black
OL,17,     Fcab, and Tommy Walsh visits
